Subject: [Krypton] Wire the KryptonUI runtime contract and build flag

Declare the Windows x64 shell flag and link the process-lifetime runtime
loader without changing Chromium compiler settings. The separate host
adapter will consume this contract; runtime failures must not select
the original browser chrome. Keep generated headers in Chromium's
existing browser-generated dependency group.

--- a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
@@ -5455,6 +5455,7 @@
 # units are compiled.
 group("browser_generated_files") {
   public_deps = [
+    "//chrome/browser/ui/krypton_ui:buildflags",
     ":buildflags",
     "//chrome/browser/media:media_engagement_preload_proto",
     "//chrome/browser/media:mojo_bindings",
